  unitName: Disciple Zurg
  unitId: 60543
  unitNumber: 675
  description: The disciple of the god Afla Dilith. He has the tendency to acknowledge
    the strength of those who possess it, regardless of their race. This does not
    mean that he considers them as equals, but rather that they have the potential
    to become valuable subordinates for himself. Using his underlings to fight on
    the battlefield, he is rarely seen at the front lines. However, it is said that
    during his battle with the servants of the last Fallen God, Zevalhua, this disciple
    attacked with his own power for once, dying enemy after enemy bright red with
    their own blood.
  summonDesc: If you could enslave me,<br>you must really possess<br>terrifying powers.
  fusionDesc: Human.<br>Do you seek more power<br>though you live so sinfully?
  evoDesc: 
